### Add two numbers (the route exercised by the e2e test)
GET http://localhost:3000/testing/add?a=2&b=3

### Non-number input returns 400
GET http://localhost:3000/testing/add?a=foo&b=3

### Run the tests from the project root:
###   pnpm test               # runs all *.spec.ts (unit + e2e style)
###   pnpm test math.service  # run just the unit test
